  "topicId": "puc2-statistics-08-statistical-inference-testing-of-hypothesis.t4",
  "stem": {
   "en": "For a t-test of a single mean with a sample of 12 observations, the degrees of freedom are:"
  },
  "options": [
   {
    "en": "24"
   },
   {
    "en": "12"
   },
   {
    "en": "10"
   },
   {
    "en": "11"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 3,
