   },
   {
    "en": "t ≈ 4.21; H₀ is rejected at 5%"
   },
   {
    "en": "t ≈ 2.10; H₀ is not rejected at 5%"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 0,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "Pooled s² = (9 × 10 + 11 × 12)/20 = 11.1. SE = √(11.1 × (1/10 + 1/12)) = 1.427. t = 3/1.427 ≈ 2.10 > 2.086, so reject."
  },
  "exams": [
   "PUC"
  ],
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "tags": []
 },
 {
  "id": "2t08-q21",
