    "en": "the smaller variance divided by the larger"
   },
   {
    "en": "the larger sample variance divided by the smaller"
   },
   {
    "en": "the difference of the two variances"
   },
   {
    "en": "the product of the two variances"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 1,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "F = s₁²/s₂² with the larger estimate on top, so F ≥ 1 and the upper-tail table can be used."
  },
